able, utilizing renewable energy and vertical farming.","level":"B1","questions":[{"q":"What is a feature of future cities?","options":["More cars","Vertical farming","Coal power"],"a":"b"}]},"writing":{"prompt":"How can we make cities more eco-friendly?"},"vocab":[{"word":"Infrastructure","meaning":"基础设施","syn":"Foundations","ex":"The city needs better infrastructure."},{"word":"Renewable","meaning":"可再生的","syn":"Sustainable","ex":"Solar power is a renewable energy source."},{"word":"Urbanization","meaning":"城市化","syn":"Urban growth","ex":"Rapid urbanization causes congestion."},{"word":"Congestion","meaning":"拥挤 / 堵塞","syn":"Traffic jam","ex":"Traffic congestion is a major problem."},{"word":"Environment","meaning":"环境","syn":"Nature","ex":"We must protect the environment."}]},"3":{"theme":"The Impact of AI","reading":{"title":"The Impact of AI","text":"Artificial Intelligence is changing everything from healthcare to education, but raises ethical concerns.","level":"B1","questions":[{"q":"What does AI raise?","options":["Taxes","Ethical concerns","Buildings"],"a":"b"}]},"writing":{"prompt":"Will AI replace human workers in the future?"},"vocab":[{"word":"Automation","meaning":"自动化","syn":"Mechanization","ex":"Automation replaces manual labor."},{"word":"Algorithms","meaning":"算法","syn":"Procedures","ex":"AI relies on complex algorithms."},{"word":"Intelligence","meaning":"智力 / 智能","syn":"Intellect","ex":"Artificial intelligence is growing."},{"word":"Innovative","meaning":"创新的","syn":"Inventive","ex":"Apple is an innovative company."},{"word":"Breakthrough","meaning":"突破","syn":"Advance","ex":"A major medical breakthrough."}]},"4":{"theme":"Space Exploration","reading":{"title":"Mars Colonization","text":"The idea of colonizing Mars is no longer science fiction. Private companies are racing to build the first settlements.","level":"B2","questions":[{"q":"Who is racing to build settlements?","options":["Governments only","Private companies","Aliens"],"a":"b"}]},"w